SUMMARY:Escape Room Time - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nIt is esc
 ape room time.\n\nThe event comes to you courtesy of our WhatsApp group ch
 at.\n\nJoin us at 7:20 p.m.\, 7:40 p.m. or 7:50 p.m. on Friday\, July 31 a
 t Amazing Escape Room\, 281 Liberty St. in Bloomfield.\n\nThe cost per per
 son is $33 per person. PLEASE PAY IN ADVANCE. Details are below.\n\nTechni
 cally\, a room can only accommodate up to 10\, 11 or 12 people. No food or
  drinks are allowed on site. There is street parking.\n\n\\*\\*\\* There i
 s a good chance we'll hang out some more at a diner or bar afterward. Feel
  free to make suggestions!! \\*\\*\\*\n\nThese are the groups thus far! If
  you want to be added\, subtracted\, or moved\, just let me know. We're fl
 exible!\n\nGroup #1 (Last Night in Vegas @ 7:20 p.m.) - Kyle M (PAID)\, Sh
 raddha (PAID)\, Sasmit (PAID)\, Christy S. (PAID)\, Kulwinder\, Hardik\, K
 ewal\n\nGroup #2 (Lost in Space @ 7:40 p.m.) - Chloe P (PAID)\, Leena (PAI
 D)\, Leena's Guest #1 (PAID/Rahul)\, Leena's Guest #2 (PAID/Jui-Chin)\, Le
 ena's Guest #3 (PAID/Yun-Ya)\, Cedric B\, Ray\, Jeffrey G\n\nGroup #3 (Shi
 pwreck @ 7:50 p.m.) Andy M (PAID)\, Satish (PAID)\, Fran (PAID)\, Wola O (
 PAID)\, Wola's Guest (PAID)\, Andrea R (PAID)\, Robert K\, Robert's Guest\
 nMaybes - Suzy\, Cara and Ramzy Y\n\nPAYMENT INFO: I've got Venmo\, Zelle\
 , PayPal and Cash App. Try to locate my account with my email first. [andy
 milone@verizon.net](mailto:andymilone@verizon.net) Or it may show up under
  my name Andy Milone or Andrew Milone. Or try 201-406-7222. You can try my
  other number\, 201-234-9609\, BUT PLEASE DON'T USE IT FOR VENMO! That is 
 no longer my account. Thank you everyone!!! Feel free to reach out with an
 y questions!!\n\nMore info: https://amazingescaperoom.com/all-rooms/\n\nQu
 estions or comments? You can message Andy on Meetup\, or call/text him at 
 201-234-9609.\n\nThis is our first escape room trip. Feel free to also che
 ck out bowling\, soccer\, volleyball\, tennis or one of our other activiti
 es at: www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleyball.
