SUMMARY:Dan Santat Summer Storytelling Challenge Ends
DESCRIPTION:Join Summer Reading Ambassador Dan Santat's creative challenge! 
 Complete his artwork with your own words and enter for a chance to win free 
 books.\n\nFor ages 8 -12.\n\nPackets can be picked up from the children's 
 desk. All completed work must be turned in by August 1st to qualify to win. 
 \n\n
