DESCRIPTION:This workshop is your introduction to the many ways University
  Libraries can support your success at Montclair State and beyond. We wil
 l discuss resources available and how to access them. Such as:\n\nmuseum 
 passes\nbooks and articles\nnap pods and magazines\ngames and puzzles\nst
