DESCRIPTION:**Shomrei Sings** Facilitated by Guest Prayer Leader Talia Lak
 ritz  \n  \nClick_here_for_a_list_of_prayers_with_recordings: https://www.
 google.com/url?q=https://drive.google.com/file/d/1kryY7ZzPNChoqp_bmN7_Naiz
 c0rcaQpD/view?usp%3Ddrive_link&sa=D&source=calendar&ust=1781360754684895&u
 sg=AOvVaw2T_AqOEEflqogj_jj2vH1M  \n  \nLearn new melodies and practice som
 e familiar tunes to enhance our communal prayer experience. We need all of
  our voices to build a participatory\, joyous service full of spirited son
 g!   \n  \nMost songs/prayers will be in Hebrew\, but all levels of Hebrew
  knowledge are welcome. Transliteration will be provided.   \n  \nSinging/
 musical experience not required.  \n  \n  \n**Watch a Livestream Broadcast
  (non-interactive)** https://www.google.com/url?q=http://shomrei.org/lives
 tream&sa=D&source=calendar&ust=1781360754684895&usg=AOvVaw1iRP_mXCD4EDlCeY
 hSpscD  \n  \n**Questions?** Contact Shomrei Office  \noffice@shomrei.org 
  \n(973) 746-5031\n\n
