SUMMARY:Board of Trustees Monthly Meeting 
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260915T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260915T210000
DTSTAMP:20260730T032251Z
UID:2eq0gis348ik9cb62ea1dbl9pg_R20260721T230000@google.com__20260915
SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20160706T194033Z
DESCRIPTION:Our Board of Trustees is committed to upholding our Unitarian 
 Universalist Congregation at Montclair values. The Board actively and refl
 ectively holds themselves accountable to <a href="https://www.uumontclair
 .org/uucmboard/09/2020/board-covenant/">their Covenant</a>. The Board is c
 omprised of a five person executive committee and seven trustees at large.
