SUMMARY:Bedazzled Library Cards - TEEN & ADULT
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Library Card Sign Up Month by adding a little sparkle 
 to your library card!\n\nJoin us for a Crafternoon of Bedazzling Library 
 Cards - Follow the card design or create your own.\n\nYA & Adults | grades 
 6  | Reg Req*\n*Glen Ridge patron priority
