SUMMARY:Mah Jongg Open Play Club
DESCRIPTION:The "open play" format enables anyone with prior knowledge of 
 the game to attend and join a table.\n\nMany players will be beginners. 
 There is no instructor.\n\nThere will a limited number of NMJL cards from 
 previous years and Mah Jongg sets available.\n\nPlease bring sets and cards 
 if you own them.\n\nAdditional dates:\n\nAugust 10 & 24\n\nSeptember 14 & 
 28\n
LOCATION:West Caldwell - Community Meeting Room
ORGANIZER;CN="West Caldwell Public Library":MAILTO:programs@westcaldwell.bccls.org
CATEGORIES:Club
UID:LibCal-10340-17135207
URL:https://bccls.libcal.com/event/17135207
