SUMMARY:Movie: Marry Me
DESCRIPTION:As Kat Valdez prepares for her live\, on-stage wedding\, she 
 finds out about her husband-to-be's infidelity. In a heartbroken moment of 
 spontaneity\, Kat singles out Charlie\, a stranger in the crowd\, and 
 offers to marry him instead. Now\, they must navigate the public spotlight 
 together.
